<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to 10 July  -ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to 10 July  -ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in the Eurobond and related markets fell to $1.019 trillion in the week to July 3 from $1.112 trillion in the previous week, International Securities Market Association figures show (in billions of dollars).</p>
<p>					    LATEST WEEK	PREVIOUS WEEK</p>
<p> PRIMARY MARKET:			  62.33			57.67</p>
<p> OF WHICH U.S. DOLLAR ISSUES:	 36.66			32.26</p>
<p> SECONDARY MARKET:		     957.45		    1044.30</p>
<p> OF WHICH U.S. DOLLAR ISSUES:	233.19		     283.92</p>
<p> CLEARED THROUGH EUROCLEAR	   725.81		     771.86</p>
<p> CLEARED THROUGH CEDEL		 294.02		     341.11</p>
<p>--London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
